00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:39.100
a vocabulary as we saw in an earlier video, and then map each of these words to, say,

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:44.060
one-hot vectors or to indices in your vocabulary.

00:03:44.060 --> 00:03:50.140
One thing you might also want to do is model when sentences end. So another common thing to do

